\" пластине (PNG)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"8\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Валидация солвера на аналитическом решении\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PEN\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"d8e013f0-0737-425e-b46a-35139b351d5f\\\"}\\n[20:57:16.191] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text_delta\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"DING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"9\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CLI и конфигурация параметров ячейки\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" }\\\\n    ]\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"4ce04740-40e1-4d75-8573-959c29a7d577\\\"}\\n[20:57:16.192] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"model\\\":\\\"claude-sonnet-5\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_011Cd9QG9n9WMRedurMZN6mS\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"message\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Принял оба решения по умолчанию:\\\\\\\\n- Сборка: Gradle (Kotlin DSL) — стандартный выбор для Kotlin JVM-проекта, даёт нормальную структуру src/main/kotlin и управление зависимостями.\\\\\\\\n- Визуализация: экспорт heatmap в PNG через встроенный javax.imageio (без внешних библиотек) — просто, без лишних зависимостей, результат сразу открывается любым просмотрщиком.\\\\\\\\n- Геометрия №1: коаксиальная/кольцевая ячейка, смоделирована в осесимметричных координатах (r, z) — пластина-анод как диск при z=0 радиусом waferRadius, кольцевой катод на высоте ringZ между ringInnerRadius и ringOuterRadius. Такая аппроксимация физически корректна для этой конфигурации ячейки.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nЭтим ответом создаю каркас проекта: Gradle-обвязку и три модуля — geometry (описание ячейки и её областей), solver (интерфейс численного решателя поля потенциала), visualization (интерфейс экспорта карты тока в PNG) — плюс точку входа Main.kt. Реализация самого численного решателя (FDM/SOR) и реального рендеринга будет в следующих шагах плана.\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"commitMessage\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"chore: bootstrap Gradle Kotlin project with cell simulation module skeleton\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"modifications\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:settings.gradle.kts\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"rootProject.name = \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"testVibes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:build.gradle.kts\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"plugins {\\\\\\\\n    kotlin(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"jvm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\") version \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"1.9.24\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n    application\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ngroup = \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"com.testvibes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\nversion = \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"1.0.0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nrepositories {\\\\\\\\n    mavenCentral()\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ndependencies {\\\\\\\\n    testImplementation(kotlin(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"test\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"))\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nkotlin {\\\\\\\\n    jvmToolchain(17)\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\napplication {\\\\\\\\n    mainClass.set(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"com.testvibes.cell.MainKt\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ntasks.test {\\\\\\\\n    useJUnitPlatform()\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/Main.kt\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"package com.testvibes.cell\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nfun main() {\\\\\\\\n    println(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Simulation of current distribution in an electrochemical cell for HF etching of porous silicon.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n    println(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Skeleton project. Initial geometry: coaxial/ring cell (axisymmetric r-z model).\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/geometry/Geometry.kt\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"package com.testvibes.cell.geometry\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nenum class CellRegion { ELECTROLYTE, ANODE_WAFER, CATHODE, INSULATOR }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\n * A cell geometry classifies every point of the simulation domain into a region\\\\\\\\n * (electrolyte, anode wafer, cathode, insulating wall) so the solver can apply\\\\\\\\n * the right boundary/source condition there.\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\ninterface CellGeometry {\\\\\\\\n    val widthMeters: Double\\\\\\\\n    val heightMeters: Double\\\\\\\\n    fun regionAt(xMeters: Double, yMeters: Double): CellRegion\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\n * Axisymmetric coaxial/ring cell: x = radial coordinate r, y = axial coordinate z.\\\\\\\\n * The wafer (anode) is a disk at z = 0 with radius [waferRadiusMeters].\\\\\\\\n * The ring cathode sits at z = [ringZMeters], between [ringInnerRadiusMeters] and [ringOuterRadiusMeters].\\\\\\\\n * The outer domain boundary (r = domainRadiusMeters) is treated as an insulating wall.\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\ndata class CoaxialRingGeometry(\\\\\\\\n    val domainRadiusMeters: Double,\\\\\\\\n    val domainHeightMeters: Double,\\\\\\\\n    val waferRadiusMeters: Double,\\\\\\\\n    val ringInnerRadiusMeters: Double,\\\\\\\\n    val ringOuterRadiusMeters: Double,\\\\\\\\n    val ringZMeters: Double\\\\\\\\n) : CellGeometry {\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override val widthMeters: Double get() = domainRadiusMeters\\\\\\\\n    override val heightMeters: Double get() = domainHeightMeters\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override fun regionAt(xMeters: Double, yMeters: Double): CellRegion {\\\\\\\\n        val r = xMeters\\\\\\\\n        val z = yMeters\\\\\\\\n        return when {\\\\\\\\n            z <= 1e-9 && r <= waferRadiusMeters -> CellRegion.ANODE_WAFER\\\\\\\\n            kotlin.math.abs(z - ringZMeters) < 1e-9 && r in ringInnerRadiusMeters..ringOuterRadiusMeters -> CellRegion.CATHODE\\\\\\\\n            r >= domainRadiusMeters - 1e-9 -> CellRegion.INSULATOR\\\\\\\\n            else -> CellRegion.ELECTROLYTE\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/solver/Solver.kt\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"package com.testvibes.cell.solver\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nimport com.testvibes.cell.geometry.CellGeometry\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\n * A discretized electric potential field over the cell domain, solution of\\\\\\\\n * div(sigma * grad(phi)) = 0 with the geometry's boundary conditions.\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\ninterface PotentialField {\\\\\\\\n    val nx: Int\\\\\\\\n    val ny: Int\\\\\\\\n    val dx: Double\\\\\\\\n    val dy: Double\\\\\\\\n    fun potentialAt(i: Int, j: Int): Double\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\ninterface CellSolver {\\\\\\\\n    /**\\\\\\\\n     * Solves for the potential field given an applied voltage between anode and\\\\\\\\n     * cathode and the electrolyte's electrical conductivity (S/m).\\\\\\\\n     */\\\\\\\\n    fun solve(geometry: CellGeometry, appliedVoltageVolts: Double, electrolyteConductivitySPerM: Double): PotentialField\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/visualization/Visualization.kt\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"package com.testvibes.cell.visualization\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\n * Exports a 2D scalar field (e.g. current density along the wafer surface) as a\\\\\\\\n * PNG heatmap using javax.imageio, with no external rendering dependency.\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\ninterface CurrentDistributionExporter {\\\\\\\\n    fun exportHeatmapPng(values: DoubleArray, width: Int, height: Int, outputPath: String)\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"plan\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Симуляция распределения тока в электрохимической ячейке (HF-травление пористого кремния)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"steps\\\\\\\": [\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Физическая и математическая модель\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Архитектура проекта (Gradle + модули geometry/solver/visualization)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"IN_PROGRESS\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"3\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Коаксиальная/кольцевая геометрия и расчётная сетка\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Численный солвер (FDM, Gauss-Seidel/SOR)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"5\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Граничные условия на пластине (линейная модель / Батлер-Фольмер)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"6\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Альтернативные геометрии (плоскопараллельная, локальный электрод)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"7\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Визуализация heatmap тока на пластине (PNG)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\