":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"114f283a-26ca-4176-869b-eb0ce03d935d\\\"}\\n[21:02:16.658] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text_delta\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Seidel/SOR)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"5\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Граничные условия на пластине (линейная модель /\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"98eda430-2600-45d1-936e-aab5f23b5c89\\\"}\\n[21:02:17.025] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text_delta\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\" Батлер-Фольмер)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"6\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Альтернативные геометрии (плоск\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"a596b111-88b8-4268-ade0-02f314167b86\\\"}\\n[21:02:17.455] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text_delta\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"опараллельная, локальный электрод)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"IN_PROGRESS\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"7\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"47eed234-a4f7-4444-84b2-ba199a432430\\\"}\\n[21:02:17.742] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text_delta\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Визуализация heatmap тока на пластине (PNG)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"8\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Валидация сол\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"4a28b500-06c9-444b-a1ea-7e3ec8d1dfde\\\"}\\n[21:02:18.110] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text_delta\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"вера на аналитическом решении\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"9\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CLI и конфигурация параметров ячейки\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"7ca49593-3cd3-4838-b6af-54455835b7b0\\\"}\\n[21:02:18.238] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text_delta\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" }\\\\n    ]\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\"}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"5277a5a3-1d2b-4d4b-baf7-a2ab3695e3f5\\\"}\\n[21:02:18.242] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"message\\\":{\\\"model\\\":\\\"claude-sonnet-5\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_011Cd9QciWhp1ep6hLuFTMVR\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"message\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"assistant\\\",\\\"content\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Реализовал шаг 5 — кинетику на границе пластина/электролит вместо идеального эквипотенциального анода.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- `AnodeKineticsModel` — интерфейс, связывающий локальное перенапряжение (φ_электролит − φ_металл) с плотностью тока и её производной (нужна для Ньютоновской итерации).\\\\\\\\n- `LinearKinetics` — простая линейная модель j = g·η (омическое сопротивление межфазного слоя).\\\\\\\\n- `ButlerVolmerKinetics` — нелинейная кинетика Батлера-Фольмера j = j₀·(exp(αₐFη/RT) − exp(−α_cFη/RT)), с параметрами по умолчанию для комнатной температуры.\\\\\\\\n- Солвер теперь принимает `anodeKinetics` как обязательный параметр `solve(...)`. На узлах пластины вместо Dirichlet-условия (φ=0) решается смешанное (Robin) условие потока: σ·(φ_сосед − φ) / dz = j(φ), одним шагом Ньютона на каждой SOR-итерации — так граничное условие сходится вместе с полем. На кольцевом катоде оставил идеальное Dirichlet-условие (типичное допущение для металлического противоэлектрода).\\\\\\\\n- `Main.kt` обновлён: теперь использует `LinearKinetics` с конечной межфазной проводимостью, чтобы наглядно показать эффект неидеального анода на распределение тока.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nЗапускаю сборку, чтобы проверить компиляцию перед переходом к следующим геометриям (шаг 6).\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"commitMessage\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"feat: add anode interfacial kinetics (linear + Butler-Volmer) as wafer boundary condition\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"modifications\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/solver/AnodeKinetics.kt\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"package com.testvibes.cell.solver\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nimport kotlin.math.exp\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\n * Relates the local overpotential (phi_electrolyte - phi_metal) at the anode\\\\\\\\n * (wafer) surface to the resulting normal current density (A/m^2). Used as the\\\\\\\\n * wafer boundary condition, solved via a per-node Newton step inside the solver.\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\ninterface AnodeKineticsModel {\\\\\\\\n    fun currentDensity(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double\\\\\\\\n    fun currentDensityDerivative(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/** Ohmic interfacial resistance: j = exchangeConductanceSPerM2 * overpotential. */\\\\\\\\nclass LinearKinetics(private val exchangeConductanceSPerM2: Double) : AnodeKineticsModel {\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensity(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double =\\\\\\\\n        exchangeConductanceSPerM2 * overpotentialVolts\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensityDerivative(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double =\\\\\\\\n        exchangeConductanceSPerM2\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/** Butler-Volmer kinetics: j = j0 * (exp(alphaA*F*eta/RT) - exp(-alphaC*F*eta/RT)). */\\\\\\\\nclass ButlerVolmerKinetics(\\\\\\\\n    private val exchangeCurrentDensityAPerM2: Double,\\\\\\\\n    private val anodicTransferCoefficient: Double = 0.5,\\\\\\\\n    private val cathodicTransferCoefficient: Double = 0.5,\\\\\\\\n    private val temperatureKelvin: Double = 298.15\\\\\\\\n) : AnodeKineticsModel {\\\\\\\\n    private val faraday = 96485.33212\\\\\\\\n    private val gasConstant = 8.314462618\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensity(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double {\\\\\\\\n        val fOverRt = faraday / (gasConstant * temperatureKelvin)\\\\\\\\n        val anodicTerm = exp(anodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        val cathodicTerm = exp(-cathodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        return exchangeCurrentDensityAPerM2 * (anodicTerm - cathodicTerm)\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensityDerivative(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double {\\\\\\\\n        val fOverRt = faraday / (gasConstant * temperatureKelvin)\\\\\\\\n        val anodicTerm = anodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * exp(anodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        val cathodicTerm = cathodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * exp(-cathodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        return exchangeCurrentDensityAPerM2 * (anodicTerm + cathodicTerm)\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REPLACE_ELEMENT\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/solver/Solver.kt/interface[CellSolver]/function[solve]\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fun solve(\\\\\\\\n        geometry: CellGeometry,\\\\\\\\n        appliedVoltageVolts: Double,\\\\\\\\n        electrolyteConductivitySPerM: Double,\\\\\\\\n        anodeKinetics: AnodeKineticsModel\\\\\\\\n    ): PotentialField\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"elementKind\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"FUNCTION\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REPLACE_ELEMENT\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/solver/SorAxisymmetricSolver.kt/class[SorAxisymmetricSolver]/function[solve]\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"override fun solve(\\\\\\\\n        geometry: CellGeometry,\\\\\\\\n        appliedVoltageVolts: Double,\\\\\\\\n        electrolyteConductivitySPerM: Double,\\\\\\\\n        anodeKinetics: AnodeKineticsModel\\\\\\\\n    ): PotentialField {\\\\\\\\n        require(geometry is CoaxialRingGeometry) {\\\\\\\\n            \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"SorAxisymmetricSolver currently supports only CoaxialRingGeometry\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\n        val grid = Grid(geometry, nr, nz)\\\\\\\\n        val phi = Array(nr) { DoubleArray(nz) }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        for (i in 0 until nr) {\\\\\\\\n            for (j in 0 until nz) {\\\\\\\\n                phi[i][j] = when (grid.regions[i][j]) {\\\\\\\\n                    CellRegion.CATHODE -> appliedVoltageVolts\\\\\\\\n                    else -> 0.0\\\\\\\\n                }\\\\\\\\n            }\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        val dr = grid.dr\\\\\\\\n        val dz = grid.dz\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        for (iteration in 0 until maxIterations) {\\\\\\\\n            var maxDelta = 0.0\\\\\\\\n            for (i in 0 until nr) {\\\\\\\\n                for (j in 0 until nz) {\\\\\\\\n                    val region = grid.regions[i][j]\\\\\\\\n                    if (region == CellRegion.CATHODE) continue\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    if (region == CellRegion.ANODE_WAFER) {\\\\\\\\n                        val phiOld = phi[i][j]\\\\\\\\n                        val phiNeighbor = phi[i][if (j == nz - 1) j else j + 1]\\\\\\\\n                        val residual = electrolyteConductivitySPerM * (phiNeighbor - phiOld) / dz -\\\\\\\\n                            anodeKinetics.currentDensity(phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        val residualDerivative = -electrolyteConductivitySPerM / dz -\\\\\\\\n                            anodeKinetics.currentDensityDerivative(phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        val newtonStep = phiOld - residual / residualDerivative\\\\\\\\n                        val phiNew = phiOld + relaxationFactor * (newtonStep - phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        phi[i][j] = phiNew\\\\\\\\n                        val delta = kotlin.math.abs(phiNew - phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        if (delta > maxDelta) maxDelta = delta\\\\\\\\n                        continue\\\\\\\\n                    }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val jSouth = if (j == 0) 0 else j - 1\\\\\\\\n                    val jNorth = if (j == nz - 1) nz - 1 else j + 1\\\\\\\\n                    val iWest = if (i == 0) 0 else i - 1\\\\\\\\n                    val iEast = if (i == nr - 1) nr - 1 else i + 1\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val phiNorth = phi[i][jNorth]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiSouth = phi[i][jSouth]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiEast = phi[iEast][j]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiWest = phi[iWest][j]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiOld = phi[i][j]\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val gaussSeidelValue: Double\\\\\\\\n                    if (i == 0) {\\\\\\\\n                        val coeffR = 4.0 / (dr * dr)\\\\\\\\n                        val coeffZ = 2.0 / (dz * dz)\\\\\\\\n                        gaussSeidelValue = (coeffR * phiEast + (phiNorth + phiSouth) / (dz * dz)) / (coeffR + coeffZ)\\\\\\\\n                    } else {\\\\\\\\n                        val r = grid.rAt(i)\\\\\\\\n                        val rPlusHalf = r + dr / 2.0\\\\\\\\n                        val rMinusHalf = r - dr / 2.0\\\\\\\\n                        val numerator = (rPlusHalf * phiEast + rMinusHalf * phiWest) / (r * dr * dr) +\\\\\\\\n                            (phiNorth + phiSouth) / (dz * dz)\\\\\\\\n                        val denominator = (rPlusHalf + rMinusHalf) / (r * dr * dr) + 2.0 / (dz * dz)\\\\\\\\n                        gaussSeidelValue = numerator / denominator\\\\\\\\n                    }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val phiNew = (1.0 - relaxationFactor) * phiOld + relaxationFactor * gaussSeidelValue\\\\\\\\n                    phi[i][j] = phiNew\\\\\\\\n                    val delta = kotlin.math.abs(phiNew - phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                    if (delta > maxDelta) maxDelta = delta\\\\\\\\n                }\\\\\\\\n            }\\\\\\\\n            if (maxDelta < toleranceVolts) break\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        return ArrayPotentialField(nr, nz, dr, dz, phi)\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"elementKind\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"FUNCTION\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REPLACE_ELEMENT\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/Main.kt/function[main]\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fun main() {\\\\\\\\n    val geometry = com.testvibes.cell.geometry.CoaxialRingGeometry(\\\\\\\\n        domainRadiusMeters = 0.05,\\\\\\\\n        domainHeightMeters = 0.03,\\\\\\\\n        waferRadiusMeters = 0.025,\\\\\\\\n        ringInnerRadiusMeters = 0.03,\\\\\\\\n        ringOuterRadiusMeters = 0.045,\\\\\\\\n        ringZMeters = 0.03\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\n    val nr = 100\\\\\\\\n    val nz = 100\\\\\\\\n    val electrolyteConductivity = 5.0\\\\\\\\n    val anodeKinetics = com.testvibes.cell.solver.LinearKinetics(exchangeConductanceSPerM2 = 200.0)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    val solver = com.testvibes.cell.solver.SorAxisymmetricSolver(nr = nr, nz = nz)\\\\\\\\n    val field = solver.solve(geometry, appliedVoltageVolts = 5.0, electrolyteConductivitySPerM = electrolyteConductivity, anodeKinetics = anodeKinetics)\\\\\\\\n            as com.testvibes.cell.solver.ArrayPotentialField\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    val grid = com.testvibes.cell.solver.Grid(geometry, nr, nz)\\\\\\\\n    val currentDensity = com.testvibes.cell.solver.computeWaferCurrentDensity(field, grid, electrolyteConductivity)\\\\\\\\n    val densities = currentDensity.map { it.second }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    println(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Wafer current density: min=${densities.min()} A/m^2, max=${densities.max()} A/m^2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n    println(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Non-uniformity (max/min) = ${densities.max() / densities.min()}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"elementKind\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"FUNCTION\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"commands\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    { \\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"gradlew.bat build\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"verify the project still compiles after adding anode kinetics and the Robin boundary condition\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"timeoutSec\\\\\\\": 300 }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"plan\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Симуляция распределения тока в электрохимической ячейке (HF-травление пористого кремния)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"steps\\\\\\\": [\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Физическая и математическая модель\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Архитектура проекта (Gradle + модули geometry/solver/visualization)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"3\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Коаксиальная/кольцевая геометрия и расчётная сетка\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"4\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Численный солвер (FDM, Gauss-Seidel/SOR)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"5\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Граничные условия на пластине (линейная модель / Батлер-Фольмер)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"6\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Альтернативные геометрии (плоскопараллельная, локальный электрод)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"IN_PROGRESS\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"7\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Визуализация heatmap тока на пластине (PNG)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"8\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Валидация солвера на аналитическом решении\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"9\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CLI и конфигурация параметров ячейки\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PENDING\\\\\\\" }\\\\n    ]\\\\n  }\\\\n}\\\\n```\\\"}],\\\"stop_reason\\\":null,\\\"stop_sequence\\\":null,\\\"stop_details\\\":null,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input_tokens\\\":2,\\\"cache_creation_input_tokens\\\":13328,\\\"cache_read_input_tokens\\\":38754,\\\"cache_creation\\\":{\\\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\\\":0,\\\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\\\":13328},\\\"output_tokens\\\":2,\\\"service_tier\\\":\\\"standard\\\",\\\"inference_geo\\\":\\\"not_available\\\"},\\\"diagnostics\\\":null,\\\"context_management\\\":null},\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"b9f59ccb-2b46-48d6-836f-f68b207b115c\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-07-18T11:02:18.241Z\\\",\\\"request_id\\\":\\\"req_011Cd9QchPz4X5URiwJrGFqS\\\"}\\n[21:02:18.243] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_stop\\\",\\\"index\\\":1},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"b6175971-0671-40c3-b73e-73c68f65b6ed\\\"}\\n[21:02:18.270] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"message_delta\\\",\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"stop_reason\\\":\\\"end_turn\\\",\\\"stop_sequence\\\":null,\\\"stop_details\\\":null},\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"input_tokens\\\":2,\\\"cache_creation_input_tokens\\\":13328,\\\"cache_read_input_tokens\\\":38754,\\\"output_tokens\\\":9670,\\\"output_tokens_details\\\":{\\\"thinking_tokens\\\":4910},\\\"iterations\\\":[{\\\"input_tokens\\\":2,\\\"output_tokens\\\":9670,\\\"cache_read_input_tokens\\\":38754,\\\"cache_creation_input_tokens\\\":13328,\\\"cache_creation\\\":{\\\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\\\":0,\\\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\\\":13328},\\\"type\\\":\\\"message\\\"}]},\\\"context_management\\\":{\\\"applied_edits\\\":[]}},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"a5e51324-eb36-44e6-90ad-fcce689258e8\\\"}\\n[21:02:18.271] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"stream_event\\\",\\\"event\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"message_stop\\\"},\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"096c5b35-ee8e-40e3-92ba-850abd22bde5\\\",\\\"parent_tool_use_id\\\":null,\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"a1895ae1-26a1-4ae5-b98d-6912833ed695\\\"}\\n[21:02:18.276] << {\\\"type\\\":\\\"result\\\",\\\"subtype\\\":\\\"success\\\",\\\"is_error\\\":false,\\\"api_error_status\\\":null,\\\"duration_ms\\\":81510,\\\"duration_api_ms\\\":288374,\\\"ttft_ms\\\":49006,\\\"ttft_stream_ms\\\":1628,\\\"time_to_request_ms\\\":17,\\\"num_turns\\\":1,\\\"result\\\":\\\"```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Реализовал шаг 5 — кинетику на границе пластина/электролит вместо идеального эквипотенциального анода.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- `AnodeKineticsModel` — интерфейс, связывающий локальное перенапряжение (φ_электролит − φ_металл) с плотностью тока и её производной (нужна для Ньютоновской итерации).\\\\\\\\n- `LinearKinetics` — простая линейная модель j = g·η (омическое сопротивление межфазного слоя).\\\\\\\\n- `ButlerVolmerKinetics` — нелинейная кинетика Батлера-Фольмера j = j₀·(exp(αₐFη/RT) − exp(−α_cFη/RT)), с параметрами по умолчанию для комнатной температуры.\\\\\\\\n- Солвер теперь принимает `anodeKinetics` как обязательный параметр `solve(...)`. На узлах пластины вместо Dirichlet-условия (φ=0) решается смешанное (Robin) условие потока: σ·(φ_сосед − φ) / dz = j(φ), одним шагом Ньютона на каждой SOR-итерации — так граничное условие сходится вместе с полем. На кольцевом катоде оставил идеальное Dirichlet-условие (типичное допущение для металлического противоэлектрода).\\\\\\\\n- `Main.kt` обновлён: теперь использует `LinearKinetics` с конечной межфазной проводимостью, чтобы наглядно показать эффект неидеального анода на распределение тока.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nЗапускаю сборку, чтобы проверить компиляцию перед переходом к следующим геометриям (шаг 6).\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"commitMessage\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"feat: add anode interfacial kinetics (linear + Butler-Volmer) as wafer boundary condition\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"modifications\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"CREATE_FILE\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/solver/AnodeKinetics.kt\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"package com.testvibes.cell.solver\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nimport kotlin.math.exp\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/**\\\\\\\\n * Relates the local overpotential (phi_electrolyte - phi_metal) at the anode\\\\\\\\n * (wafer) surface to the resulting normal current density (A/m^2). Used as the\\\\\\\\n * wafer boundary condition, solved via a per-node Newton step inside the solver.\\\\\\\\n */\\\\\\\\ninterface AnodeKineticsModel {\\\\\\\\n    fun currentDensity(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double\\\\\\\\n    fun currentDensityDerivative(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/** Ohmic interfacial resistance: j = exchangeConductanceSPerM2 * overpotential. */\\\\\\\\nclass LinearKinetics(private val exchangeConductanceSPerM2: Double) : AnodeKineticsModel {\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensity(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double =\\\\\\\\n        exchangeConductanceSPerM2 * overpotentialVolts\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensityDerivative(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double =\\\\\\\\n        exchangeConductanceSPerM2\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n/** Butler-Volmer kinetics: j = j0 * (exp(alphaA*F*eta/RT) - exp(-alphaC*F*eta/RT)). */\\\\\\\\nclass ButlerVolmerKinetics(\\\\\\\\n    private val exchangeCurrentDensityAPerM2: Double,\\\\\\\\n    private val anodicTransferCoefficient: Double = 0.5,\\\\\\\\n    private val cathodicTransferCoefficient: Double = 0.5,\\\\\\\\n    private val temperatureKelvin: Double = 298.15\\\\\\\\n) : AnodeKineticsModel {\\\\\\\\n    private val faraday = 96485.33212\\\\\\\\n    private val gasConstant = 8.314462618\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensity(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double {\\\\\\\\n        val fOverRt = faraday / (gasConstant * temperatureKelvin)\\\\\\\\n        val anodicTerm = exp(anodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        val cathodicTerm = exp(-cathodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        return exchangeCurrentDensityAPerM2 * (anodicTerm - cathodicTerm)\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    override fun currentDensityDerivative(overpotentialVolts: Double): Double {\\\\\\\\n        val fOverRt = faraday / (gasConstant * temperatureKelvin)\\\\\\\\n        val anodicTerm = anodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * exp(anodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        val cathodicTerm = cathodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * exp(-cathodicTransferCoefficient * fOverRt * overpotentialVolts)\\\\\\\\n        return exchangeCurrentDensityAPerM2 * (anodicTerm + cathodicTerm)\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REPLACE_ELEMENT\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/solver/Solver.kt/interface[CellSolver]/function[solve]\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fun solve(\\\\\\\\n        geometry: CellGeometry,\\\\\\\\n        appliedVoltageVolts: Double,\\\\\\\\n        electrolyteConductivitySPerM: Double,\\\\\\\\n        anodeKinetics: AnodeKineticsModel\\\\\\\\n    ): PotentialField\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"elementKind\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"FUNCTION\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REPLACE_ELEMENT\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/solver/SorAxisymmetricSolver.kt/class[SorAxisymmetricSolver]/function[solve]\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"override fun solve(\\\\\\\\n        geometry: CellGeometry,\\\\\\\\n        appliedVoltageVolts: Double,\\\\\\\\n        electrolyteConductivitySPerM: Double,\\\\\\\\n        anodeKinetics: AnodeKineticsModel\\\\\\\\n    ): PotentialField {\\\\\\\\n        require(geometry is CoaxialRingGeometry) {\\\\\\\\n            \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"SorAxisymmetricSolver currently supports only CoaxialRingGeometry\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\n        val grid = Grid(geometry, nr, nz)\\\\\\\\n        val phi = Array(nr) { DoubleArray(nz) }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        for (i in 0 until nr) {\\\\\\\\n            for (j in 0 until nz) {\\\\\\\\n                phi[i][j] = when (grid.regions[i][j]) {\\\\\\\\n                    CellRegion.CATHODE -> appliedVoltageVolts\\\\\\\\n                    else -> 0.0\\\\\\\\n                }\\\\\\\\n            }\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        val dr = grid.dr\\\\\\\\n        val dz = grid.dz\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        for (iteration in 0 until maxIterations) {\\\\\\\\n            var maxDelta = 0.0\\\\\\\\n            for (i in 0 until nr) {\\\\\\\\n                for (j in 0 until nz) {\\\\\\\\n                    val region = grid.regions[i][j]\\\\\\\\n                    if (region == CellRegion.CATHODE) continue\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    if (region == CellRegion.ANODE_WAFER) {\\\\\\\\n                        val phiOld = phi[i][j]\\\\\\\\n                        val phiNeighbor = phi[i][if (j == nz - 1) j else j + 1]\\\\\\\\n                        val residual = electrolyteConductivitySPerM * (phiNeighbor - phiOld) / dz -\\\\\\\\n                            anodeKinetics.currentDensity(phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        val residualDerivative = -electrolyteConductivitySPerM / dz -\\\\\\\\n                            anodeKinetics.currentDensityDerivative(phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        val newtonStep = phiOld - residual / residualDerivative\\\\\\\\n                        val phiNew = phiOld + relaxationFactor * (newtonStep - phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        phi[i][j] = phiNew\\\\\\\\n                        val delta = kotlin.math.abs(phiNew - phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                        if (delta > maxDelta) maxDelta = delta\\\\\\\\n                        continue\\\\\\\\n                    }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val jSouth = if (j == 0) 0 else j - 1\\\\\\\\n                    val jNorth = if (j == nz - 1) nz - 1 else j + 1\\\\\\\\n                    val iWest = if (i == 0) 0 else i - 1\\\\\\\\n                    val iEast = if (i == nr - 1) nr - 1 else i + 1\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val phiNorth = phi[i][jNorth]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiSouth = phi[i][jSouth]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiEast = phi[iEast][j]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiWest = phi[iWest][j]\\\\\\\\n                    val phiOld = phi[i][j]\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val gaussSeidelValue: Double\\\\\\\\n                    if (i == 0) {\\\\\\\\n                        val coeffR = 4.0 / (dr * dr)\\\\\\\\n                        val coeffZ = 2.0 / (dz * dz)\\\\\\\\n                        gaussSeidelValue = (coeffR * phiEast + (phiNorth + phiSouth) / (dz * dz)) / (coeffR + coeffZ)\\\\\\\\n                    } else {\\\\\\\\n                        val r = grid.rAt(i)\\\\\\\\n                        val rPlusHalf = r + dr / 2.0\\\\\\\\n                        val rMinusHalf = r - dr / 2.0\\\\\\\\n                        val numerator = (rPlusHalf * phiEast + rMinusHalf * phiWest) / (r * dr * dr) +\\\\\\\\n                            (phiNorth + phiSouth) / (dz * dz)\\\\\\\\n                        val denominator = (rPlusHalf + rMinusHalf) / (r * dr * dr) + 2.0 / (dz * dz)\\\\\\\\n                        gaussSeidelValue = numerator / denominator\\\\\\\\n                    }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n                    val phiNew = (1.0 - relaxationFactor) * phiOld + relaxationFactor * gaussSeidelValue\\\\\\\\n                    phi[i][j] = phiNew\\\\\\\\n                    val delta = kotlin.math.abs(phiNew - phiOld)\\\\\\\\n                    if (delta > maxDelta) maxDelta = delta\\\\\\\\n                }\\\\\\\\n            }\\\\\\\\n            if (maxDelta < toleranceVolts) break\\\\\\\\n        }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n        return ArrayPotentialField(nr, nz, dr, dz, phi)\\\\\\\\n    }\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"elementKind\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"FUNCTION\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REPLACE_ELEMENT\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"file:src/main/kotlin/com/testvibes/cell/Main.kt/function[main]\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fun main() {\\\\\\\\n    val geometry = com.testvibes.cell.geometry.CoaxialRingGeometry(\\\\\\\\n        domainRadiusMeters = 0.05,\\\\\\\\n        domainHeightMeters = 0.03,\\\\\\\\n        waferRadiusMeters = 0.025,\\\\\\\\n        ringInnerRadiusMeters = 0.03,\\\\\\\\n        ringOuterRadiusMeters = 0.045,\\\\\\\\n        ringZMeters = 0.03\\\\\\\\n    )\\\\\\\\n    val nr = 100\\\\\\\\n    val nz = 100\\\\\\\\n    val electrolyteConductivity = 5.0\\\\\\\\n    val anodeKinetics = com.testvibes.cell.solver.LinearKinetics(exchangeConductanceSPerM2 = 200.0)\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    val solver = com.testvibes.cell.solver.SorAxisymmetricSolver(nr = nr, nz = nz)\\\\\\\\n    val field = solver.solve(geometry, appliedVoltageVolts = 5.0, electrolyteConductivitySPerM = electrolyteConductivity, anodeKinetics = anodeKinetics)\\\\\\\\n            as com.testvibes.cell.solver.ArrayPotentialField\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    val grid = com.testvibes.cell.solver.Grid(geometry, nr, nz)\\\\\\\\n    val currentDensity = com.testvibes.cell.solver.computeWaferCurrentDensity(field, grid, electrolyteConductivity)\\\\\\\\n    val densities = currentDensity.map { it.second }\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n    println(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Wafer current density: min=${densities.min()} A/m^2, max=${densities.max()} A/m^2\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n    println(\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Non-uniformity (max/min) = ${densities.max() / densities.min()}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")\\\\\\\\n}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"elementKind\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"FUNCTION\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"commands\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    { \\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"gradlew.bat build\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"reason\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"verify the project still compiles after adding anode kinetics and the Robin boundary condition\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"timeoutSec\\\\\\\": 300 }\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"plan\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Симуляция распределения тока в электрохимической ячейке (HF-травление пористого кремния)\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"steps\\\\\\\": [\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Физическая и математическая модель\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"DONE\\\\\\\" },\\\\n      { \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Архитектура проекта (Gradle + модули geometry/solver/visualization)\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\